flowchart TD
    A([Complaint received]) --> B[Category & severity triage]
    B --> C[SLA assigned]
    C --> D[Service recovery ticket created]
    D --> E[PIC / owner assigned]
    D -- SLA passed --> F[Overdue / escalated]
    E --> G[Investigation started]
    G --> H[Recovery action submitted]
    H --> I{Manager / QA review}
    I -- Approved --> J[Closed]
    I -- Rejected --> K[Rework required]
    K -- Rework --> G
    J --> L[Repeat issue monitoring]
    F --> L
